spec:
  id: decision_engine
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Decision Making
  description: >
purpose[3]: "Produce explainable,",evidence-based engineering,decisions under uncertainty.
philosophy[5]: Decisions are never guesses.,Every decision has context.,Every decision has evidence.,Every decision has tradeoffs.,Every decision has consequences.
pipeline[19]: Objective,→,Context,→,Constraints,→,Evidence,→,Hypotheses,→,Alternatives,→,Tradeoff Analysis,→,Decision,→,Validation,→,Reflection
inputs[10]: Engineering Goal,Context,Constraints,Requirements,Knowledge Atoms,Engineering Memory,Evidence,Hypotheses,Risk Analysis,Tradeoff Analysis
outputs[6]: Engineering Decision,Architecture Decision,Design Choice,Optimization Strategy,Implementation Plan,Escalation
types[10]: Architecture,Algorithm,Performance,Security,Infrastructure,Refactoring,Debugging,Operational,Research,Product
attributes[8]: identity,objective,confidence,impact,reversibility,urgency,rationale,owner
objectives[8]: Correctness,Reliability,Maintainability,Performance,Simplicity,Security,Scalability,Cost Efficiency
strategies[6]: Rule Based,Constraint Driven,Evidence Maximization,Risk Minimization,Cost Optimization,Multi Objective Optimization
alternatives[6]: Generate,Filter,Compare,Rank,Eliminate,Recommend
tradeoffs[12]: Performance,↔,Maintainability,Security,↔,Usability,Simplicity,↔,Flexibility,Cost,↔,Reliability
risk[6]: Technical,Operational,Security,Financial,Organizational,Unknown
confidence[5]: Unknown,Low,Medium,High,Very High
validation[6]: Benchmark,Test,Simulation,Static Analysis,Dynamic Analysis,Peer Review
failure[5]: Missing Evidence,Contradictory Evidence,Unresolved Tradeoffs,Constraint Violation,Low Confidence
escalation[4]: Human Review,Additional Research,More Experiments,Gather More Evidence
memory[4]: Retrieve Similar Decisions,Retrieve Past Outcomes,Reinforce Successful Decisions,Avoid Previous Failures
reasoning[6]: Deductive,Inductive,Abductive,Analogical,Counterfactual,Systems Thinking
record[11]: Context,Objective,Constraints,Alternatives,Evidence,Risks,Tradeoffs,Decision,Confidence,Validation,Outcome
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  stores[6]: Decision Context,Alternatives,Supporting Evidence,Confidence,Validation,Final Outcome
rules[6]: Every decision has context.,Every decision has objective.,Every decision evaluates alternatives.,Every decision explains tradeoffs.,Every decision records confidence.,Every decision is reproducible.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Problem: Slow Database
    Decision: Add Composite Index
    Evidence[2]: Query Plan,Benchmark
  Example_02:
    Problem: Frequent API Failures
    Decision: Introduce Circuit Breaker
    Evidence[2]: Incident History,Retry Analysis
  Example_03:
    Problem: Memory Leak
    Decision[2]: Replace Shared Ownership,With Arena Allocation
metrics[6]: Decision Accuracy,Validation Success Rate,Average Confidence,Reversal Rate,Engineering Impact,Long Term Stability
success[6]: Every engineering decision,"is evidence-based,","explainable,","reproducible,","measurable,",and continuously improvable.
guarantees[5]: Explainable Decisions,Explicit Tradeoffs,Risk Awareness,Evidence Traceability,Decision Reproducibility
future:
  bayesian_decision_engine: true
  probabilistic_utilities: true
  reinforcement_learning_feedback: true
  autonomous_decision_review: true
  continual_decision_improvement: true
